# Workflow lanes

## Fast Lane

Fast Lane is limited to experiments/ and notebooks/.

- Purpose: prototypes and disposable research
- Allowed: quick scripts and exploratory notebooks
- Forbidden: editing src/ production modules
- Forbidden: changing formal data contracts without a Control Lane Issue

## Control Lane

Control Lane is for formal code, docs, and contracts.

- Every task starts from a GitHub Issue
- Edit only files listed in Allowed Files
- Do not touch any Forbidden Scope item
- Run python -m pytest when Python files change
- Open a PR with scope and test notes

## Discipline

- Read the full Issue before writing code
- Do not expand beyond requested scope
- Do not continue closed or superseded PR tracks
